# SIL App Builder - Interactive Quiz Questions Data File

[Question 1]
id = q_001
type = MultipleChoice
text = What does a .sil file represent in this development project?
A = The styling worksheet configuration
B = The master project configuration file
C = The quiz question data array
D = The compiled application bundle
answer = B
hint = It shares its name with the organization that created the software framework.

[Question 2]
id = q_002
type = MultipleChoice
text = Which file extension handles the look, feel, and margins of the worksheet view?
A = .qst
B = .ch
C = .sil
D = .cls
answer = D
hint = Think of a master "class" file that guides styling templates.
